    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to the regional line &quot;Shuppatsu-eki - Densha Terminal&quot;!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chill Train - Densha No Kuni is a small arcade/simulation train game with simple controls that puts you in the role of a driver on a fictional line.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each journey is evaluated, and achieving an &quot;S&quot; rank on every route will require great precision and focus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Serve the various stops at the scheduled times and handle the many events that arise during the journey, such as speed restrictions, level crossings, or unexpected maintenance work, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 base routes await to test your driving skills, with varying numbers of stops and different weather conditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But with a bit of perseverance, you might unlock the brand-new high-speed &quot;Inazuma&quot; train and its dedicated routes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See you soon on the &quot;Shuppatsu-eki &gt; Densha Terminal&quot; line!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to the regional line &quot;Shuppatsu-eki - Densha Terminal&quot;!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chill Train - Densha No Kuni is a small arcade/simulation train game with simple controls that puts you in the role of a driver on a fictional line.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each journey is evaluated, and achieving an &quot;S&quot; rank on every route will require great precision and focus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Serve the various stops at the scheduled times and handle the many events that arise during the journey, such as speed restrictions, level crossings, or unexpected maintenance work, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 base routes await to test your driving skills, with varying numbers of stops and different weather conditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But with a bit of perseverance, you might unlock the brand-new high-speed &quot;Inazuma&quot; train and its dedicated routes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See you soon on the &quot;Shuppatsu-eki &gt; Densha Terminal&quot; line!</p>",
    "short_description": "Become the driver of a regional train on the fictional &quot;Shuppatsu-eki - Densha Terminal&quot; line. Chill Train - Densha No Kuni is a small arcade/simulation train game with simple controls, putting you in the role of a driver on a short urban line.",
